Subject: Update PHP pear dependencies

Rename pear/* to pear-pear.php.net/* (pkg-php-tools' naming convention for
mapping PEAR-channel packages to Debian package names) and relax the
version operators from ~/^ to >=, matching Debian's usual practice for
this source package. Ported forward from the equivalent Debian patch
(same intent, rebased against 1.7.4's actual dependency list - this
version doesn't attempt to move optional deps into "suggest" like the
original did, since upstream itself no longer separates them that way).

Origin: Debian
Forwarded: not-needed
